      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "もうすぐ、うちのばあさんの誕生日でな。\nあいつの好きな花を花束にして贈ってやりたい。\nお前さん、元気が有り余っていそうじゃな。\n代わりに集めて来てくれんか？　頼んだぞ。",
        "official_en": "My wife's birthday is coming up and I'd like to get\nher a bouquet of her favorite flowers. You seem to\nhave the energy for it! Could you do an old man a\nfavor and collect some for me?",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
