      },
      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "ありがとう。お前さんが花を集めてくれたから、\nばあさんの墓に花を供えることができそうじゃ。\n毎年、誕生日に花を持っていくんじゃ。\nこの命続く限り、供えてやりたいもんじゃ。",
        "official_en": "Thank you for gathering these flowers. With these, I\ncan make her final resting place as beautiful as she\nwas. I try to bring flowers every year for her\nbirthday. And... I hope I get to for as long as I live.",
        "real_en": null
